  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adaptation Fund 2021- 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multiyear agreement with the World Bank for support to the Adaptation Fund (2021-2024). The fund is an official financial mechanism under the Kyoto Protocol and the Paris Agreement and funds climate adaptation projects in vulnerable countries.</narrative>
  </description>
